        stepDurationMs ?? this.stepDurationMs,
      ),
      lineWidth: _normalizeLineWidth(lineWidth ?? this.lineWidth),
    );
  }

  static int _normalizeStepDuration(dynamic raw) {
    final value = raw is num ? raw.toInt() : 1200;
